WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:23.330
<i>Stay away!</i>

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:26.250
<i>I hate you now!</i>

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:27.540
<i>I hate you!</i>

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.250
<i>I never want to see you again!</i>

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.170
<i>Why, Rie? What happened?</i>

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:35.760
<i>What did...</i>

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.550
<i>Is it because of Gai?</i>

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:42.350
<i>But what would Gai want with Rie?</i>

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:46.730
<i>No, he's a Busoma now. He's not human.</i>

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:51.110
<i>If he would kill Ogata,
<i>anything else wouldn't be strange.</i></i>

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:55.110
<i>But why would Rie reject me?</i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.530
Clam soup and Spanish mackerel meunière.

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:02.700
Please eat while it's still warm.

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:07.160
No. Can you take it away?
I'm not hungry.

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:11.750
I'm sorry to hear that, sir.
Shouldn't you have a little, at least?

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.590
I tried some earlier,
and it was delicious.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:20.430
Maybe I can feed you,
like I did when you were a child?

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:21.760
Shut up!

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.510
I said take it away,
so shut up and take it away!

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.810
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.020
Master Shin?

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:30.900
I'm sorry.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.480
I was deep in thought, and...

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.570
I'm really sorry. Please don't be upset.

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.240
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.740
<i>This isn't who I am!</i>

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:46.160
<i>Calm down. I'm me!
<i>I need to stay as myself.</i></i>

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:57.210
<i>Brother.</i>

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.720
I'm glad she's okay.

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.350
The doctors were amazed
at how quickly she recovered.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.810
As expected from your daughter, Master.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.140
Yes.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.690
But I suppose this is fate.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.690
Gai, I mean.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:20.240
I gave him the Shiryu as an arm

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:24.160
because the Shiryu possessed Sayaka
and she cut it off.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.660
They say that fate comes around,

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:32.670
but the fate binding Gai
and the Shiryu must be cut somewhere.

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:35.420
<i>It's my fault?</i>

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.550
<i>I cut off Gai's arm?</i>

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.760
Please, Matoba!

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.760
Let me see Gai!

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.760
Where is he now?

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.180
Ogata, calm down!

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.060
I have to apologize!

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.940
I have to apologize to Gai!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:57.020
Apologize? Why do you have to apologize?

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:00.030
He's the one who hurt you!

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.610
It's my fault!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.860
I did a horrible thing!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.700
So please, Matoba!

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:07.700
Calm down!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.120
You saw it, too, right?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.460
He's a Busoma now. He's not human!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:19.460
I don't care! I want to see Gai again!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:24.010
It feels strange...

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.850
My blood is inside you.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.430
It feels like we've gotten closer.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:33.560
That doesn't matter. Gai is...

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.940
Doesn't matter?

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.150
I'm sorry.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:43.740
I heard from the nurses
that your blood transfusion saved me.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:45.530
Thank you.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.240
You shouldn't move around too much.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.410
If I find Gai, I'll contact you.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:03.420
Doesn't matter?

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.970
It's not good enough to protect you,

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:14.730
but I want you to have it.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.850
<i>Gai... It's my fault!</i>

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.650
<i>It's my fault this happened to Gai!</i>

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.530
Master, what is this?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.910
What do you think of it, Ookawa?

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:33.830
Y-Yes.

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:37.580
Just seeing the way it shines seems
to purify my heart.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:39.960
Well observed.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:44.340
Your time here hasn't gone
to waste, it seems.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:49.760
This is the tamahagane,
given to us by Kigetsu of Hagakure Shrine.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:54.520
A metal spoken of since ancient times,
in which the gods of the moon dwell.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.730
The gods of the moon?

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:59.440
If things such as demon swords exist,

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.400
there are also divine blades
that exceed their power.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:07.780
This tamahagane will become a divine blade
that will shatter the demon swords.

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:11.450
A-And use it against the Shiryu?

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:16.870
Yes, the fate binding Gai
and the Shiryu must be cut.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.630
And I intend to give everything
that I am to the task.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.350
Gods, give me power!

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.940
So you'll accept your fate?

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:51.660
And live your life as a Chrysalis?

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.120
Yes.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.160
As you know, Father,

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:59.160
I have always opposed the use
of violence.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.170
Violence creates more violence, I said.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.340
My thoughts on that still haven't changed.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:10.550
But to create the tranquil world
that I dream of,

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.510
I might require a wind to blow away evil.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.890
I will be that wind!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.890
A wind that blows away evil.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.240
Father...

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:36.660
I don't want to lose you.
But I will accept your choice.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:41.370
I, myself, chose to take command here,
to fight the Busoma.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:43.420
Thank you.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:48.000
It's not just you.
Rie is my treasure, as well.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.220
I'm searching for her now.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.390
Do you have a lead?

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:00.480
That's...

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.730
Security camera footage
from the hospital Rie was staying at.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:07.110
Rie disappeared shortly after this.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:09.230
I've met that thing!

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.320
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.200
<i>It wasn't Gai Ogata who attacked her?</i>

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:21.620
What's wrong?

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:25.790
<i>Commander Matoba,
<i>a Busoma has appeared in Area E.3!</i></i>

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.760
Gai!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:34.260
My friend... my only friend!

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:36.140
Gai changed.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:38.510
Because everyone was mean to him!

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:43.690
Gai is mad!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.600
Everyone, apologize to Gai!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:46.520
Stop it!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.860
Is that you, Shin?

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.370
You're...

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:03.370
I see. So you were a Busoma too?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:08.170
It's too bad.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.260
I thought you were a kind person.

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:16.260
It's everyone else's fault
for being mean to Gai!

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.720
That's why he changed!

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:20.510
He was my friend!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.180
You seem to misunderstand.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:25.730
Gai is...

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.030
If you need a friend, you've got me.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.280
Shin? You're my friend?

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.370
Of course. That's what I believe.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:44.160
Do you not think so?
That would make me sad.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.160
Really?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.790
Friends?

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:51.040
Yeah! So since we're friends,
let's work together!

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:53.460
You and I, two as one!

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:54.880
Yeah!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.220
Together we can save Gai!

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:58.640
Save him?

00:09:58.970 --> 00:09:59.840
Yes.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:04.970
A demon is currently controlling him.
That's why he's changed.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:07.980
A demon? Like a bad guy?

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:11.520
That's right.
Together we'll defeat the demon!

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:14.360
Do we have to fight Gai?

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:16.990
It's to save him.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:20.320
But... I don't want to fight him.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.700
I see. Then I'm sad.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:26.200
I thought you were my friend.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.330
Shin!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.500
Wait! Hold on!

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:45.560
Mr. Matoba, for many years,
we Apostolo 3

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:48.940
have provided financial support
to the Shoshidai.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.650
And even though you're one of us,

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:54.070
you would take command
of the Shoshidai yourself?

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:59.320
We respect your passion,
but we do have some doubts.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:01.360
Doubts?

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:06.830
You've taken complete control
of Shoshidai Branch Office 3.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:09.660
The Shoshidai plays a critical role
in humanity's future.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:13.080
It does not exist
for one man's personal desires.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.340
There's no need to worry.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.920
I care more about humanity's future
than anyone.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.260
I ceased to be just "one man"
a long time ago.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:26.140
Then why did you alter the results
of the Prismaphon research data?

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:29.270
Alter? What are you talking about?

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:33.900
Do you think you can fool us,
of all people?

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:39.820
It's true that a Prismaphon injection
temporarily lowers Maldicion values.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.570
Enough to return being a human.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:48.080
But afterwards, without exception,
the Maldicion values rapidly increase,

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:51.080
stabilizing at extremely high levels.

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:54.170
At this point, it's a catalyst
to turn humans into Busoma!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:59.210
Our goal is to manage the Chrysali
to counter potential threats,

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:04.430
and develop a drug that could stave off
a Busoma pandemic.

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:07.350
What are you scheming?

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:08.770
Ridiculous.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.310
You haven't realized?

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.230
The Busoma are humanity's future.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:16.310
What do you mean?

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.650
We humans make weapons.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.570
Weapons are what have allowed us
to survive and evolve.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:27.080
Now humanity will become one
with these weapons.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.580
Isn't it the logical evolution?

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:34.500
And the result was the birth
of a pure life form, the Busoma.

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:38.000
You would praise the Busoma?

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:41.760
I have learned something
in my long service of humanity...

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.550
Humanity is gripped
by an incurable disease.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:51.470
Uncertainty, pain, sorrow, fear,
anger, obsession, jealousy...

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:55.730
Humans are ruled
by such ridiculous emotions.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:58.980
But becoming Busoma saves them!

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.320
N-Nonsense!

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:05.700
Kazuma Matoba!
We demand you step down immediately!

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.410
That's my line.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.660
I order you to step down.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.410
Matoba, you traitor--

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:15.420
What happe--

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.800
Mission complete.

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:27.590
Mission complete.

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:33.100
A Busoma's existence is maintained solely
by it's desire for slaughter.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.940
Do you understand the beauty
of such a simple existence?

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:40.360
Are they not as pure as angels?

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:47.030
And these angelic Busoma
shall put humanity on the cross.

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:51.280
Doing so shall save their souls.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.170
I'm sorry, Gai.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:02.880
I'm sorry...

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:13.060
It's dangerous! Come down, Gai!

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.640
What are you looking at, Gai?

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.270
Nothing.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.610
Maybe if I climb a taller tree,
I could see it.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.730
See what? What could you see?

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:26.570
Who cares?

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:30.200
Let's go home, Gai! The sun is setting!

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:32.490
Come on, Gai!

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:37.040
Let's go home, Gai!

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:44.050
<i>Things were wonderful back then.</i>

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:48.130
<i>No matter where Gai was,
<i>I could find him right away.</i></i>

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.550
<i>But now... Now I can't...</i>

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.440
Wait! Gai!

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.230
Gai.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:14.330
Gai!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.830
<i>Wait for me, Gai!</i>

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.220
Was it you who called me?

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.850
So you want to end this?

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:43.020
Lady Himiko, let us return home
to the mountains.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.150
You must purify yourself.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:48.730
Nonsense. We must end this here.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:51.990
And I have my promise to keep with Gai.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:54.030
I have a bad feeling.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:57.030
Are you saying I'll lose to Gai?

00:15:57.740 --> 00:16:02.290
No, I'm worried that obsession
will destroy you.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.380
Listen to you, Kazumo.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:08.500
It makes me feel better
knowing you're here.

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:12.930
Lady Himiko?

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:17.140
Can you not feel it, Kazumo?
The wind stopped.

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:35.740
<i>A Busoma has appeared!</i>

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:52.090
Gai!

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:56.760
It saddens me to see you swallowed up
by the desire for death.

00:16:57.390 --> 00:16:59.430
This being is not Gai.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:03.640
No, Gai's soul remains alive within you.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.560
I will take that soul.

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:11.780
Lady Himiko!

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:14.110
Out of the way!

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:34.260
Now it's your turn, Gai!

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:37.220
You're not a normal human.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:41.060
A human who can absorb Sage Alma?

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:43.560
Lady Himiko!

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:49.110
Don't worry. The Alma
was simply stronger than I thought.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:56.070
You're only human in the end.
I guess that's all you've got.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.200
Gai... or rather, Busoma!

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:06.080
I won't let you run wild anymore!

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.620
Let's go, Kuromaru!

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:08.540
R-Right.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.510
That's not Gai!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.510
A demon's taken him over!
Don't hesitate!

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:25.220
What's wrong?

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:28.810
I-I can't do it! Gai is my friend!

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:32.820
What are you talking about?
I'm the one who's your friend!

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:35.690
You promised, remember?
That we'd fight together!

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.190
So fight!

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.700
No! You're not my friend after all!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.450
My friend is Gai!

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.450
You bastard!

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:48.160
You... you would betray me, too?

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.500
No, I...

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:53.880
Stop!

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:56.380
O-Ogata?

00:18:56.710 --> 00:19:00.380
Stop! Don't... don't hurt Gai!

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:04.350
Impossible! He tried to kill you.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.720
So why...

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:11.270
It's all my fault. It's because of me!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.070
I'm sorry, Gai!

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.440
I didn't know anything.

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:20.570
I heard from Dad that it was my fault.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.200
That I cut off your arm!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.160
I'm sorry.

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:32.040
I'm so... sorry!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.920
Stop it!

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:41.510
Why? Why are you looking at Gai?
Why won't you look at me?

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.430
I'm the one who saved you!

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:46.560
My blood is within you!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:49.180
If it weren't for me, you'd be dead!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.100
So why?

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:54.560
Why does everyone leave me?

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:57.730
You... and Rie!

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:00.740
Ridiculous.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.160
Gai!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:11.620
That's...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:16.420
Lady Himiko!

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:25.590
